<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Mobil said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Mobil said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney upgraded Mobil Corp to buy from outperform, a Smith Barney source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended at 121-1/8 on Friday.</p>
</text>
